# HP39gs/HP40gs stock serial-disk fixture probe.
# F6 dismisses the stock boot prompt used by the direct-runtime gate.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6

# HP39 matrix aliases:
#   G/H/I -> SYMB/PLOT/NUM
#   J/K/L -> HOME/APLET/VIEWS
7000 tap aplet
8000 capture aplet-library
9000 tap f5
10000 capture receive-menu

# HP39gs RECEIVE FROM order, verified against stock ROM 2.22:
#   HP39 (IrDA)
#   HP39/40 (USB)
#   HP39/40 (Ser)
#   USB Disk drive
#   Ser. Disk drive
10500 tap down
10800 capture receive-usb
11200 tap down
11500 capture receive-serial
11900 tap down
12200 capture receive-usb-disk
12600 tap down
12900 capture receive-serial-disk

13300 tap enter
18000 capture serial-disk-active
35000 finish-install
